      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-23T22:00:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the EE rulebook it says</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Additionally, there are times when players may encoutner ambiguous situations, such as tied to HP. In any ambiguous stuations, the players choose the outcome.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>so yes, while Trex says that I have to ask real quick... What was the Villian HP? Because he was likely the Highest HP target, and then all the heroes above would be tied for 2nd place. Meaning the above rule comes into place, making it player choice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(remember, trex says The second highest /target/ other than itself, and anything with HP is a target)</p>",
